sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant DB as cyclotron_jobs
    participant Fast as Fast email fleet (down)
    participant Main as Main email fleet
    participant Jan as Janitor
    participant Alert as Alerting
    Fast->>DB: rows it held stay running, heartbeat stops
    Main->>DB: next poll takes priority 0 rows first (today's behavior)
    Jan->>DB: after the stall timeout, held rows return to available
    Main->>DB: dequeue them (a send already handed to SES can repeat)
    Alert-->>Alert: no available fast pods for 5 min, page
